1
00:00:06,117 --> 00:00:10,783
What makes a life one life? A
habit one habit? A river one river?

2
00:00:11,593 --> 00:00:15,399
The logic of substance has one
answer: something persists.

3
00:00:15,479 --> 00:00:19,475
A soul, a stream of
consciousness, a neural core,

4
00:00:19,555 --> 00:00:21,553
the energy that is conserved.

5
00:00:21,633 --> 00:00:24,950
Each is put forward as the
carrier that runs through time.

6
00:00:25,030 --> 00:00:28,007
Take it away, the substantialist expects,

7
00:00:28,087 --> 00:00:30,874
and only disconnected flashes remain.

8
00:00:30,954 --> 00:00:33,664
Each moment would be
sealed off from the next.

9
00:00:34,482 --> 00:00:37,758
The logic of dependency
rejects both pictures:

10
00:00:37,838 --> 00:00:40,140
the carrier, and the disconnection.

11
00:00:40,953 --> 00:00:43,984
Nāgasena's lamp is the classic image.

12
00:00:44,064 --> 00:00:48,631
The flame in the last watch of the night
is not the flame of the first watch.

13
00:00:48,711 --> 00:00:50,302
Nor is it a different flame.

14
00:00:50,382 --> 00:00:52,748
Nothing passes from one to the next.

15
00:00:52,828 --> 00:00:56,063
Yet the second is not
unconnected with the first.

16
00:00:56,143 --> 00:01:00,207
Continuity is designated,
named and relied on,

17
00:01:00,287 --> 00:01:04,559
across a succession that is neither
identical nor wholly different.

18
00:01:05,392 --> 00:01:08,844
Think of a melody known by
heart. Each playing is new.

19
00:01:08,924 --> 00:01:10,556
None is the one before.

20
00:01:10,636 --> 00:01:13,586
There is no tune stored
somewhere between playings,

21
00:01:13,666 --> 00:01:15,258
waiting to be released.

22
00:01:15,338 --> 00:01:18,206
Yet the tune is recognised
across them all.

23
00:01:18,286 --> 00:01:23,971
It can be played well or badly, remembered
or forgotten, changed by practice.

24
00:01:24,798 --> 00:01:28,713
Habit, character, skill
and karma are like this.

25
00:01:28,793 --> 00:01:31,743
Each moment is conditioned
by what went before.

26
00:01:31,823 --> 00:01:34,582
The link is real, and it is reliable.

27
00:01:34,662 --> 00:01:37,150
But it is designated across the moments.

28
00:01:37,230 --> 00:01:39,831
It is not carried by something
running through them.

29
00:01:40,629 --> 00:01:41,844
Two things follow.

30
00:01:41,947 --> 00:01:43,877
First, nothing is lost.

31
00:01:43,957 --> 00:01:49,869
Memory, responsibility, learning, and the
karmic continuity the tradition describes

32
00:01:49,949 --> 00:01:53,107
all remain, as designations that hold.

33
00:01:53,929 --> 00:01:56,118
Second, nothing is fixed.

34
00:01:56,198 --> 00:02:01,267
A continuity with no essence inside
it can bend. A habit can loosen.

35
00:02:01,347 --> 00:02:04,365
A character can soften.
A grievance can end.

36
00:02:04,445 --> 00:02:07,780
There was never anything underneath
that had to stay the same.

37
00:02:08,583 --> 00:02:13,585
Continuity without a carrier is more
reliable than the nihilist expects.

38
00:02:13,665 --> 00:02:16,932
And it is more open than the
substantialist can allow.

